        },
        {
          "text": "Aana chimbosio khu wele be babaandu ba Damasika, ba baba ne bamuulile. Ebaasia ali “Bawele be babaami ba Shamu babayeeta. Ne ese naba ne mbaanila chimbosio banyala banjeeta akhaba seesi.” Ne kakhali bawele bano baba libuna khu Ahasia ne Isiraeli yoosi.",
          "type": "text",
