              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi abuusia alala bibiindu khukhwama mu Lukaangu lwa Wele mala abibwasulaka mu bitonyi. Lundi ekala kimiliango kie Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ombakha chi alutare khu buli khu koona eya Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
